WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.380
Gwyneth Paltrow is a lady of many talents.

00:00:02.689 --> 00:00:07.580
In addition to acting, singing, writing books,
and raising children, she's also now a Marvel

00:00:07.580 --> 00:00:08.600
secret spoiler.

00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:10.400
"Weak!

00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:11.540
So weak."

00:00:12.290 --> 00:00:16.880
In an interview with Titan Publishing's Official
Avengers: Infinity War magazine, Paltrow,

00:00:16.880 --> 00:00:21.529
who portrays Pepper Potts in the Marvel Cinematic
Universe, may have spilled a major spoiler

00:00:21.529 --> 00:00:22.620
about Avengers 4.

00:00:23.070 --> 00:00:27.000
The actress opened up about her character's
relationship with Robert Downey Jr.'s Tony

00:00:27.001 --> 00:00:31.279
Stark -- better known to the world as Iron
Man -- and as it turns out, her scene in Infinity

00:00:31.280 --> 00:00:34.520
War might have been a prelude for big news
to come from Stark Tower.

00:00:35.520 --> 00:00:39.960
In the beginning of Infinity War, Tony tells
Pepper that he had a dream she was pregnant.

00:00:40.820 --> 00:00:44.930
Pepper brushes the comment aside, neither
confirming nor denying whether she's actually

00:00:44.930 --> 00:00:48.500
expecting before Tony jets off to the cosmos
to do battle with Thanos.

00:00:49.420 --> 00:00:52.300
While Pepper might've been playing coy, Paltrow
didn't hold back.

00:00:52.920 --> 00:00:57.500
She seems to tell fans in the magazine feature
that Pepper has not only survived Thanos'

00:00:57.500 --> 00:01:01.360
Infinity Gauntlet snap, but that she's also
with child, saying:

00:01:01.760 --> 00:01:04.960
"Pepper and Tony have had a really long journey
together.

00:01:04.960 --> 00:01:10.100
She obviously starts as his dutiful assistant,
and then the relationship evolves, and now

00:01:10.100 --> 00:01:12.480
this decade later they're married, and they
have a child.

00:01:13.180 --> 00:01:16.940
Their relationship has evolved in all of the
ways that great romances evolve."

00:01:17.420 --> 00:01:21.500
The turn of phrase Paltrow used here still
invites some questions, of course.

00:01:21.900 --> 00:01:26.479
By saying the two "have a child," it could
mean that she's pregnant in Avengers 4, which

00:01:26.480 --> 00:01:29.229
would mean that the film picks up just after
Infinity War.

00:01:29.580 --> 00:01:32.860
Or it could mean that by the time the next
film comes along, she'll have already had

00:01:32.860 --> 00:01:34.920
a little one with the billionaire philanthropist
superhero.

00:01:36.080 --> 00:01:36.840
"Where's the kid?!"

00:01:36.840 --> 00:01:40.380
Of course, the lovebirds could always end
up adopting a child -- since there's bound

00:01:40.400 --> 00:01:45.200
to be plenty of orphans left in the wake of
Thanos' snap -- but in either case, it looks

00:01:45.200 --> 00:01:48.460
like the Starks will become a party of three
in Avengers 4, somehow.

00:01:49.070 --> 00:01:53.520
Considering how protective Marvel is over
their plot details, it's pretty baffling how

00:01:53.520 --> 00:01:57.850
Paltrow's remarks here made it to print, but
perhaps the studio just wanted to give fans

00:01:57.850 --> 00:02:01.320
a reason to be optimistic after so much devastation
in Infinity War.

00:02:01.820 --> 00:02:03.200
"Go team, yeah!"

00:02:03.880 --> 00:02:07.760
After all, what better way to say goodbye
to the guy who started it all than to make

00:02:07.779 --> 00:02:13.400
him turn a complete 180 from the selfish,
spoiled magnate he once was into a doting

00:02:13.400 --> 00:02:16.300
dad who wants to live a humble, quiet life
instead?

00:02:16.300 --> 00:02:20.440
Whatever does come of this news, let's just
hope we get some kind of happy ending, and

00:02:20.440 --> 00:02:23.820
not the Tony-and-his-son-die-together one
as seen in the comics.

00:02:24.640 --> 00:02:28.580
We'll know for sure what Paltrow's mention
of Pepper's secret bun in the oven entails

00:02:28.580 --> 00:02:31.740
when Avengers 4 arrives on May 3, 2019.

00:02:32.680 --> 00:02:33.320
Thanks for watching!

